@import ./local.env
@import ./test.env

```sh
echo {{userId}}
```

- 운동 온보딩 여부 (이번에 51758이 비어 있던 항목):
```sql
SELECT * FROM user_exercise_metadata WHERE user_id = {{userId}};
```

- 세션 이력과 미종료 세션:
```sql
SELECT id, gym_id, access_history_id, started_at, end_at
FROM user_exercise_session
WHERE user_id = {{userId}}
ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 10;
```


```sql
SELECT ah.id,
       ah.type,
       ah.method,
       ah.gym_id,
       CONVERT_TZ(ah.created_at,'+00:00','+09:00') AS created_kst,
       TIMESTAMPDIFF(MINUTE, ah.created_at, UTC_TIMESTAMP()) AS min_ago
FROM access_history ah
WHERE ah.user_id = {{userId}}
  AND ah.created_at >= CONVERT_TZ(CONCAT(DATE(CONVERT_TZ(UTC_TIMESTAMP(),'+00:00','+09:00')),' 00:00:00'),'+09:00','+00:00')
ORDER BY ah.id DESC;
```